    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d869">

                <pb facs="1086" n="1076" xml:id="pg1076"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">102.1/2–1947: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-02-19T12:00:00-05:00">February 19,
                            1947—noon</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>203. For Adler from Treasury. Cable whether announced changes in monetary policy
                    affect use of Hong Kong open market rate for Navy procurement of yuan. Also
                    request info on any official measures taken to terminate use of US currency for
                    troop pay. [Treasury.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
